      "explanation": "Correct order of ionic radii:<br/><br/>\nO<sup>–2</sup> > Mg<sup>+2</sup><br/><br/>\nThis is because among isoelectronic species, the size of anions are greater than the size of cations. Statement (II) is correct as both O<sup>–2</sup> and Mg<sup>+2</sup> are isoelectronic."
